  "body": "Elevated above one of Auckland's most coveted coastal enclaves, this exceptional 411sqm (approx) freehold title invites you to build your dream home in prestigious Castor Bay.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a premium freehold section in one of Auckland's most sought after coastal suburbs with panoramic views. 29A Parr Terrace offers a rare chance to design and build a residence that reflects your vision and lifestyle. \r\n\r\nMoments from Castor Bay Beach and Milford Village, and zoned for Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools. This is a legacy location where opportunities to secure a freehold site of this size and aspect are few and far between. \r\n\r\nPlease note: The concept images included in the marketing material are concept images only and no Building or Resource Consents have been applied for in relation to these concept images. Buyers must seek their own independent planning advice regarding building potential.\r\n\r\nPlease call or enquire for viewing options and further information.",
